  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a user, I want more app icons — the HFR orange, the Beta in red, variations of the redface and icons for the seasons — so that the icon picker has something for every taste and season.\n\nOperator request of 2026-10-28, with the reviews of 10:09 and 15:40 (Legacy and Beta packs validated). M4.\n\n### Scope\n\nPer [`docs/ICONS.md`](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/ICONS.md) §2 (packs table) and §4 (style). The descriptions below are the operator's words; every drawing is as on the reference boards in [`docs/assets/themes/`](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/tree/dev-swift/docs/assets/themes) (validated by the operator, 2026-11-10). Each icon: an Icon Composer `.icon` (Default, Dark, Tinted), SVG master, registered as an alternate, added to `AppIconOption` with its pack and window.\n\n- **Legacy**: `Orange` (Blue's layout, white HFR on `orange-hfr` `#F18F18`); `Classique Blue` from legacy `HFRswift/Swift/Assets.xcassets/Classic-Blue.appiconset` @ 87fe0d1c (primary icon of the `hfrplus-legacy.red.super` target, `SuperHFRplus.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj:6297`; operator 10-28: keep it).\n- **Beta**: `Beta rouge` (the legacy Beta drawing, black strokes on red, strokes slightly thicker).\n- **X-face** (13): X-face, Fierté (diagonal Pride stripes, solid face), Fierté contour (strokes only), Dégradé clair, Dégradé sombre, Or, Or sur noir, Or contour, Terminal 5250 (green face), Négatif, Négatif inversé, Coucher de soleil.\n- **Saisons**: Halloween citrouille (redface turned orange, centred carved mouth, pumpkin ribs and orange gradient: operator 15:40), Halloween HFR (01/10–31/10), Printemps (cherry tree in bloom partly behind the face), Été (bigger sun, small coconut palm, sand that does not stop abruptly), Hiver (scarf as in the earlier version, dense random snowflakes) — all-year except Halloween.\n- **First step**: check that `Icon-REDFACE.icon/Assets/foreground.svg` (#623) keeps the measured legacy proportions (ICONS.md §4; operator 10-28: faces looked deformed on the first boards); every face icon derives from it.\n\n### Legacy counterpart\n\nNone @ 87fe0d1c except Classique Blue (above). GAP-148 edit in the `### Ledger` (packs).\n\n### Depends on\n\n- LOT-189 (#?) (pack field and windows)\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet 5.5 → Opus 5.5; Mac session for the art.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Every icon: Default, Dark, Tinted; readable at 29 pt; screenshots of all icons on light and dark Home Screens and in Clear / Tinted in the PR.\n- [ ] Halloween icons only 01/10–31/10 (calendar test).\n- [ ] No baked highlight (HIG); original art; CREDITS.md updated; the Pride flag and season symbols generic.\n- [ ] `xcodebuild build test` green; the picker shows every icon.\n\n### Before you start (agents and humans)\n\nRead AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/ICONS.md, CREDITS.md, LOT-123 and LOT-189 specs. Claim with `/claim <session-id>`; one PR per pack is fine (`Refs`), the last says `Closes`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
